# Board catalog — fillable template

> A board catalog documents the work-type domain for each board in your ticket system. Use this template to fill in the catalog for your context. **The friend running Alice's methodology fills in this template for their own boards, not the operator's specific boards.**

---

# Board catalog — [operator name]

